<title>ITALY: Italy's Ciampi to hold ENI news conference Oct 26.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ciampi to hold ENI news conference Oct 26.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi will hold a news conference at 5 p.m. (1500 GMT) on Saturday October 26 to discuss details of the sale of shares in energy giant ENI.</p>
<p>The Treasury announced the news in a statement.</p>
<p>Public subscription of the second tranche offering of ENI shares in Italy closes on Friday.</p>
<p>The final share price will be fixed on Saturday with trading expected to start on October 28.</p>
<p>The Treasury said in a statement on Thursday that it was increasing the total number of ENI shares offered for sale to 1.1 billion from 700 million.</p>
<p>-- Rome bureau 00 39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
